{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/56199-help-beginning-a-gts-game","id":56199,"title":"Help Beginning a GtS Game","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Geist: The Sin-Eaters"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-01-23T09:48:56-08:00","id":56199,"title":"Help Beginning a GtS Game","content":"Hey all, I'm a newer Storyteller who recently got some friends interested in RPGs. When going over games with them, they really seemed to like the World of Darkness, especially the capacity for a prelude adventure. They decided they wanted to do Geist, so I started working up a story for them. I have an antagonist thought up but I'm running into a bit of a problem conceptualizing the beginning of the adventure. Does anyone have any advice about running games immediately post-bargain? How do you make sure the players get together in a Krewe and create a mythos or even find other Sin-Eaters? The book is kind of vague about it and I'm worried that unless I have an idea about how this is SUPPOSED to go the game will stall or be boring. Has anyone tried running a Geist game that included a prelude or the formation of a krewe? Any advice for running Geist or storytelling in general?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2085-radischio","name":"Radischio","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-23T12:07:05-08:00","id":56276,"title":"","content":"My simpler advice is to check out my AP and steal tons of ideas. It's not immediately post bargain but has a lot of plots built into it.<br /> <br /> My other suggestion is this: Sit down and discuss with the players what you want. You want them to form a Krewe. Discuss before session one what they forsee as the possibilities and problems with this. Are two characters going to likely to be at odds? That can be cool! Have everyone discuss areas where they will clash and how they can be talked into working together, Remember it benefits everyone for the players to make the Krewe. You don't need to script everything, but generate in them all an investment in seeing it work. Many groups can be power struggles between player and GM. That can work if the whole group likes competition, I suppose, but I tend to feel the best stories can be done the easiest if everyone says &quot;how can we make this awesome?&quot;<br /> <br /> Now for mythos, the Geists tend to do that, so that can be in your hands if you like...the PCs don't do it. However, it would be a good thing to discuss with the players what they want to see. I actually had the players write ours even if it was their Geists that did it.<br /> <br /> The formative time is important for how the Krewe approaches a lot of things. I would use pre-game time to discuss everyone's expectations and get them on the same page. Then create an awesome story together.<br /> <br /> Does that help for a start?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/OnyxGraphics/OnyxMod.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Onyx Path Moderator </span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\">Forum Rules</a><br /> <span style=\"color:#FF0000\">This is my mod voice.</span> This is my goth voice.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/15731-geist-balance-of-shadows-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">[Geist: Balance of Shadows</a><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/17537-v20-the-conspiracy-of-hrad-%C4%8Dern%C3%A1-hora-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\"> ][ Vampire: The Conspiracy of Hrad \u010cern\u00e1 Hora</a><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/13838-scion-bohemian-front-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\"> ][ Scion: Bohemian Front</a>][<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/99033-changeling-malibu-dream-house-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling: Malibu Dream House</a>] [<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/268069-demon-night-train-detective-agency-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">Demon: Night Train Detective Agency</a>] <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/la94fvk\" target=\"_blank\">[WoD: The Golden Eagle</a>]","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/56-baroness-nerak","name":"Baroness Nerak","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar56_2.jpeg","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2524"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-23T14:11:26-08:00","id":56357,"title":"","content":"That certainly does help! I love reading APs so I'll be sure to check it out. I also never thought to just sit down with them and talk about the game, I kinda just expected it to be my responsibility. I'm sure their characters won't have a problem grouping up as they all seem to be playing characters similar to themselves. There's only three of them anyway so I'm sure that part won't be hard to wrangle.Thanks for clearing all this up for me, I was under the impression that the players had at least some control over their Geists. Maybe not in game, but their creation, and, by extension, anything they would create, like mythos. This makes it a lot easier on me and I get to flex my creative muscles some more.<br /> <br /> I've actually tried to talk to them about what they wanted to see in a game, and pretty much the only response I got back was &quot;I dunno.&quot; I think their being new players is going to make that part difficult, as they really don't know what they'd like to do or see, but I'm sure everything will shake out a lot better if I can actually pull some answers out of them. Thanks for taking the time to respond.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2085-radischio","name":"Radischio","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-23T17:15:33-08:00","id":56449,"title":"","content":"Every group is different. Some groups have it be 100% the GMs responsibility. I tend to like to see myself as a project leader; I make the final decision, with input. Knowing what they players want to play and what their character goals are help. Characters do change and adapt (and some players prefer to make up their personality as they go along) so don't depend on them having a clear idea, but if they do that can only help you and each other. But ultimately, what does your group want? A guided run with you as project leader or just make characters and follow along. Deciding really helps.<br /> <br /> So I guess if they don't have much for you don't press them, but let you know you have an ear open.<br /> <br /> When I started <i>Balance of Shadows</i> I asked my players if they wanted to control their Geists, have me do so, or control each others Geists. The near unanimous idea was to have them control their own, so everyone controls their own Geist. That is up to the group though. As for the Mythos, depends on player input. If they shrug a lot you may need to do it. Again, I recommend discussing.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/OnyxGraphics/OnyxMod.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Onyx Path Moderator </span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\">Forum Rules</a><br /> <span style=\"color:#FF0000\">This is my mod voice.</span> This is my goth voice.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/15731-geist-balance-of-shadows-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">[Geist: Balance of Shadows</a><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/17537-v20-the-conspiracy-of-hrad-%C4%8Dern%C3%A1-hora-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\"> ][ Vampire: The Conspiracy of Hrad \u010cern\u00e1 Hora</a><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/13838-scion-bohemian-front-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\"> ][ Scion: Bohemian Front</a>][<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/99033-changeling-malibu-dream-house-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling: Malibu Dream House</a>] [<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/268069-demon-night-train-detective-agency-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">Demon: Night Train Detective Agency</a>] <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/la94fvk\" target=\"_blank\">[WoD: The Golden Eagle</a>]","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/56-baroness-nerak","name":"Baroness Nerak","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar56_2.jpeg","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name"